{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1154639-lunar-castebooks-project","id":1154639,"title":"Lunar Castebooks Project","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-01T00:03:32-07:00","id":1154639,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Lunar Castebooks Project","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Greetings, fellow forumites. My co-author and I are overjoyed to reveal this project we've been working on all year <a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/12525268/chapters/28521488\" target=\"_blank\">here, on archive of our own (AO3)</a>. It is a fan project covering all the Lunar Castebooks we both wish were real, Changing Moon, Full Moon, No Moon, and Casteless. We won't be posting it all right away, but we will be posting five times a week (M/W/F/Sa/Su). Every so often I'll post some direct links here.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I know we won't hit everyone's collective personal ideals for Lunars, (who could? That Venn diagram has no intersection) but I do hope we can give everyone some enjoyable stories that expand Creation in our own small way. Happy reading.</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":1103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","user":"Tikor","date":". 11-01-2017, 05:43 AM"},"atta