rum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> there aren't that much lunar stuff out compared to the other exalted. Keep it up","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13712-illaden","name":"Illaden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13712_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T16:21:37-08:00","id":1157388,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the kind words. We will certainly keep it up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":1103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","user":"Tikor","date":".  Deleted out of date percentages 11-15-2017, 07:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T16:17:50-08:00","id":1159245,"title":"","content":"Hello again.<br /> <br /> A warning to our readers. Lilith's trials necessarily deal with Desus. When we post Lilith, we'll be upping the story's rating to mature and adding the tags associated with their domestic violence. So, for those in for a teen-rated good time, please skip Lilith's 'The Trials We Face' chapter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T11:38:28-08:00","id":1161221,"title":"","content":"So I have looked though all of the chapters you have out so far and I have a problem with your characters. The whole point of this book is to provide readers with npcs or inspiration for their Changing Moon characters right? The problem is that most of them don\u2019t come off as good at social stuff. Seriously out of 6 characters only Tamez and Seven Devil Clever come off as skilled socialites. I mean if I\u2019m playing a Changing Moon I likely want to play a social character right? Aside from that and the force on the silver pact that I personally just don\u2019t like I think this is pretty good. I understand what\u2019s being said and I feel I understand the characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1685-looker","name":"Looker","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T12:56:01-08:00","id":1161255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Looker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1154639-lunar-castebooks-project?p=1161221#post1161221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I have looked though all of the chapters you have out so far and I have a problem with your characters. The whole point of this book is to provide readers with npcs or inspiration for their Changing Moon characters right? The problem is that most of them don\u2019t come off as good at social stuff. Seriously out of 6 characters only Tamez and Seven Devil Clever come off as skilled socialites. I mean if I\u2019m playing a Changing Moon I likely want to play a social character right? Aside from that and the force on the silver pact that I personally just don\u2019t like I think this is pretty good. I understand what\u2019s being said and I feel I understand the characters.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I can agree a bit but also you have to think that Changing moon is 3 cast in 1 and from 2nd edition that we can base a bit of <br /> Waxing moon, Charisma, Manipulation and apperance <br /> Half moon: Charisma Perception and intelligence <br /> Waning moon Dexterity Manipulation and Wits <br /> If we are just going to with the attribute speciality and they story they write is about how the characters in the Changing moon cast is also and how they were treated and other stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13712-illaden","name":"Illaden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13712_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-21T20:36:14-08:00","id":1161409,"title":"","content":"To be honest I usually ignore the whole 3 in 1 thing. I don't see much gameplay or storytelling value in keeping it. Not enough that keeping it simple with 3 or just adding 2 more caste if you want to wouldn't be the better choice.<br /> <br /> By the way out of the characters shown who would be a half moon and who would be a waning moon because I really can't tell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1685,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1685-looker","user":"Looker","date":". 11-21-2017, 11:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1685-looker","name":"Looker","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T01:00:36-08:00","id":1161448,"title":"","content":"I have some surprises waiting for the mechanics chapters~","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T03:02:35-08:00","id":1161457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Looker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1154639-lunar-castebooks-project?p=1161409#post1161409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be honest I usually ignore the whole 3 in 1 thing. I don't see much gameplay or storytelling value in keeping it. Not enough that keeping it simple with 3 or just adding 2 more caste if you want to wouldn't be the better choice.<br /> <br /> By the way out of the characters shown who would be a half moon and who would be a waning moon because I really can't tell.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> \u200b<br /> Well The Trial We Face has a good explanation about the Changing moon cast imo<br /> Also in some of the text you can find hints or obvious proof of what the characters cast was before they became changing moon. Lilith for example, is written in The Aftermath chapter that she was a waning moon just for an example and until the 3rd edition of the Lunar book is realesed I'm going with the 2nd edition Lunar book and also Scrolls of Exalted + Lords of creation. It is a good read and Tikor and co author is doing a fine job so far imo","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13712,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13712-illaden","user":"Illaden","date":". 11-22-2017, 06:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13712-illaden","name":"Illaden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13712_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-07T21:55:09-08:00","id":1166019,"title":"","content":"I haven't 